Package: admng-openwec
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AD_MNG contributors <admng-watchdog@contoso.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS_DEPENDS@, systemd (>= 252), procps
Provides: openwec
Conflicts: openwec
Replaces: openwec
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/cea-sec/openwec
Description: OpenWEC Windows Event Collector for AdMng Watchdog
 OpenWEC (CEA-SEC) receives Windows Event Forwarding (WinRM, Kerberos) from the
 domain controllers and writes the events as RawJson files that AdMng Watchdog
 reads. Built from the pinned upstream commit @UPSTREAM_SHORT@ with a hardened
 systemd unit (openwecd.service), the AdMng configuration and the system user
 openwec.
 .
 OpenWEC is free software under the GNU GPL version 3; the complete source code
 is published next to this package (see /usr/share/doc/admng-openwec/copyright).
